'PROGRAM' FixedTest
'BEGIN'
  'FIXED'(16, 4) f1;
  'FIXED'(16, 6) f2;
  'FIXED'(16, 4) f3;
  'INTEGER' ans;
  
  f1 := 2.0;
  f2 := 2.0 * f1; 'COMMENT' 2.0 * f1 = 4.0. Fraction: f1(4) + f1(4) = 8. Target f2 has fraction 6. Shift right by 2. Result is 4.0 in fraction 6 (256);
  f3 := 4 / f1; 'COMMENT' 4 / f1 = 2.0. Fraction: target f3 has 4. shiftAmt = target(4) + right(4) - left(6) = 2. Shift f2 left by 2 before divide. (256<<2) / 32 = 1024 / 32 = 32. Result is 2.0 in fraction 4 (32);
  
  'IF' f3 = 2 'THEN'
    ans := 1
  'ELSE'
    ans := 0;
'END'
